  m_Name: Evento_BacklashContraVigilanciaUrbana
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Backlash contra Vigil\xE2ncia Urbana"
  _titleEn: Backlash against Urban Surveillance
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Sensores e c\xE2meras espalhados pela cidade coletam dados sobre as
    pessoas; sem debate p\xFAblico, a rea\xE7\xE3o pode travar projetos."
  _summaryEn: Sensors and cameras across the city collect data about people; without
    public debate, the backlash can stall projects.
  _realWorld: "O bairro inteligente que a Sidewalk Labs, empresa do Google, planejava
    em Toronto foi cancelado em 2020 depois de cr\xEDticas sobre privacidade e controle
    dos dados."
  _realWorldEn: The smart neighborhood that Sidewalk Labs, a Google sister company,
    planned in Toronto was canceled in 2020 after criticism over privacy and data
    control.
  _tradeOffs: "Transpar\xEAncia sobre o que \xE9 coletado, limites claros de uso
    e participa\xE7\xE3o dos moradores desde o in\xEDcio."
  _tradeOffsEn: Transparency about what is collected, clear limits on use and resident
    participation from the start.
  _sources:
  - Label: Sidewalk Toronto (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sidewalk_Toronto
